{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/b83bbc04aaf91314080848ef2a7a97a5.avif?t=1765574655\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/c89d3b5a4c562863967577397fb7bfa6.webp?t=1765574655\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OnSlaught\u00a0puts you in the pilot seat of an unending nightmare - where an entire alien civilization wants you <strong>dead</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll face many enemies, each demanding a unique weapon and strategy to defeat similar to classic boomer shooters like DOOM.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight flesh abominations, slingshot around black holes, and destroy an army of biomechanical alien ships.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/c89d3b5a4c562863967577397fb7bfa6.webp?t=1765574655\" width=616 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/2e48a8a63a4c860e33a5d6eb0f49226f.poster.avif?t=1765574655\" width=559 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/2e48a8a63a4c860e33a5d6eb0f49226f.webm?t=1765574655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/982119a29fae486604c